Step 22: Search for Text

Description: Search for the text line 3 in the file.

Command:

vim
/line 3


Navigation:

Press Esc to enter Normal mode.
Type /line 3 to search for the text line 3.
Press Enter to move the cursor to the first character of the first match.
Press n to go to the next match.
Press Shift + N (N) to go to the previous match.

